---
title: "Inventario de vivienda"
document_type: inventory
project_type: residential-lease
template_version: "0.2.0"
data_revision: "{{ project.data_revision }}"
lang: es
---

{% import "partials/parties.md.j2" as party_macros -%}
<p class="document-date">En {{ property.address.municipality }}, a {{ inventory.event_date|es_date }}</p>

Vivienda objeto del inventario: **{{ property.address.full_text }}**, {{ property.address.postal_code }} {{ property.address.municipality }} ({{ property.address.province }}).

## Estancias y elementos

{% for room in inventory.rooms -%}
<div class="inventory-room">
### {{ room.name }}

{% for item in room["items"] -%}
- {{ item }}
{% endfor %}

{% if room.photos is defined and room.photos -%}
<table class="photo-grid">
{% for photo_chunk in room.photos|batch(2) %}
  <tr>
  {% if photo_chunk|length == 1 %}
    <td colspan="2" class="single-photo">
      <img src="{{ photo_chunk[0] }}" alt="{{ room.name }}" />
    </td>
  {% else %}
    <td>
      <img src="{{ photo_chunk[0] }}" alt="{{ room.name }}" />
    </td>
    <td>
      <img src="{{ photo_chunk[1] }}" alt="{{ room.name }}" />
    </td>
  {% endif %}
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>
{% endif %}
</div>

{% endfor -%}

## Llaves entregadas

| Tipo | Cantidad | Fecha |
| --- | ---: | --- |
{% for key in inventory["keys"] -%}
| {{ key.kind }} | {{ key.quantity }} | {{ key.delivered_on|es_date if key.delivered_on is defined and key.delivered_on else "____________________" }} |
{% endfor %}

## Lecturas de contadores

| Suministro | Lectura | Unidad | Fecha | Observaciones |
| --- | ---: | --- | --- | --- |
{% for reading in inventory.meter_readings -%}
| {% if reading.utility == "electricity" %}electricidad{% elif reading.utility == "water" %}agua{% else %}gas{% endif %} | {{ reading.value|es_number }} | {{ reading.unit }} | {{ (reading.read_on if reading.read_on is defined and reading.read_on else inventory.event_date)|es_date }} | {% if reading.notes is defined %}{{ reading.notes }}{% endif %} |
{% endfor %}


